WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.213
In navigator.languages and
the Accept-Language header,

2
00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:06.952
browsers report the
user's languages in order.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.460
Match that list to
your supported locales,

4
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:12.908
with a default locale
as the fallback.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.666
General Translation resolves the
locale for you on every request.

6
00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:24.456
In Next.js, add createNextMiddleware
to proxy.ts as its default

7
00:00:24.456 --> 00:00:25.128
export.

8
00:00:25.528 --> 00:00:28.430
It checks the URL,
then the saved cookie,

9
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.125
then the Accept-Language header.

10
00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:34.263
An unsupported locale falls back
to the closest supported match,

11
00:00:34.263 --> 00:00:35.911
then to your defaultLocale.

12
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.947
It saves the result in the
generaltranslation.locale cookie

13
00:00:39.947 --> 00:00:41.189
for later requests.
